Subject: Make release builds local and audio-test behavior explicit
Date: 2026-10-29

Use sibling Zigzag source and include distribution inputs in the package inventory. Block broad tests unless explicitly enabled; replace audio downloads with required-fixture checks. Retain dataset-free steps, document omissions, and replace an upstream personal test path with a synthetic path. No desktop recognition logic/default changes.

