 # Olaf Tests
+
+## Release source distribution override
+
+Audio fixtures are deliberately excluded. `zig build test` fails by default,
+not passes or skips: see `../BUILDING.md`. The dataset helper now only validates
+manually supplied files and never downloads anything. The upstream instructions
+below are retained as historical test documentation, not release validation.
+Use the separate `test-matcher-v3`, `test-db-safety`, and `test-config-safety`
+steps for dataset-free CI. No compiled tests were run during source vendoring.
 
 ## Test files
 
